5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we're at the final stage, we need to be rigorous. I'm particularly concerned about our reporting overhead. I want to ensure any new addition doesn't complicate our quarter-end closing or audit process.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree that rigor is necessary. To ensure we aren't overextending our internal resources, I believe we should also examine the current state of talent acquisition and the availability of our recruitment network.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is always wonderful to see such diligence. I believe it would be wise to see how well the customers are truly staying with the companies we've supported. Shall we look into that?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. However, we must also consider our long-term capital commitments. I want to understand our future obligations and our ability to secure credit if the burn rate exceeds our projections.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,It seems we are all focusing on the internal side of things. I'm more interested in the friction between funding and actual deployment. I want to know what truly slows down the first customer's activation.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, that's a fair point. However, operational friction often translates into reporting headaches. To get a clear picture, I'll look into the appraisal needs at the last audit and independent checks on holdings' reported figures.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will focus on the human element. I'll look into the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats to see where our capacity actually stands.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I shall follow my heart and look into account retention through price rises and the delivery records of two holdings. It would be lovely to see if the customers are truly happy.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I will look into the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line. We need to be certain about our liquidity and borrowing capacity.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'll take the lead on the operational bottlenecks. I'm choosing the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings to see where the real delays occur.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I think we have a comprehensive spread. We're covering liquidity, talent, customer loyalty, and operational speed. I'm satisfied with these choices as they will highlight any hidden burdens on our reporting.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we have a balanced approach. By examining both the financial and human infrastructure, we can ensure that our next investment doesn't inadvertently disrupt the peace of our current operations.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. It is so comforting to know we are looking after both the numbers and the people. I look forward to seeing what we discover together.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"As long as we are clear on the financial risks, I am satisfied. We cannot afford any surprises regarding our capital reserves or our ability to leverage credit in the coming quarters.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is the only metric that truly matters here. While you all worry about the paperwork and the people, I'll be looking for the ghosts in the machine that stall our progress. I'm satisfied.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have all committed to our respective areas of investigation, let's proceed. I look forward to seeing how these findings align when we evaluate the candidates.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us move forward and see what the data reveals. I look forward to our next discussion.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It has been a lovely start to our process. I shall wait patiently for the results, hoping they bring us clarity and peace of mind.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's move to the investigation phase. I hope the results provide the financial certainty we need before we commit further capital.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Shion,,Let's see if the reality matches the plans. I'll be waiting to see which of these candidates is actually capable of moving at a professional pace.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
